   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; the model says line 1h omits excess elective deferrals (i1040gi p. 24, Line 1h). A filer whose elective deferrals exceeded the limit answers scope.excess_deferral (asked when a W-2 is listed, scope.excess_deferral_if_w2), which is a disjunct of scope.other_income, and f1040 refuses on scope.other_income (\"Form 1040 additional income/return forms\"), so line 1h never completes with an excess deferral. Within scope the line's strike benefits and disability pensions before minimum retirement age are the listed items.",
   "subject_key": "b826cdfb7552e8184af5e615c7d73cc59114ce45158bfc263cacd900531ec802"
  },
  {
