   "record": "e77b869fedd3e7f0294dc0afa28187c18ab7feff3f09184c67434d897af2172c",
   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; the model says line 1z leaves out line 1f. Line 1f (employer-provided adoption benefits, Form 8839 line 31) is refused: scope.adoption_benefits (\"Did an employer pay or repay any of the adoption costs ... Box 12 of a W-2 shows it with the code T\", asked when there was an adoption, scope.adoption_benefits_if_adoption) is a disjunct of scope.other_income, which f1040 refuses on. Line 1f is therefore zero on every computed return and the sum of 1a-1e, 1g and 1h equals \"Add lines 1a through 1h\" (the line's cite says so: \"line 1f, employer-provided adoption benefits, is refused by scope.adoption_benefits\").",
